<title>USA: TABLE-Alltel Corp Q2 net shr $0.92 vs $0.48.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Alltel Corp Q2 net shr $0.92 vs $0.48.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, Ark. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ALLTEL CORP</p>
<p>			 CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME</p>
<p>		(Dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			THREE MONTHS ENDED JUNE 30</p>
<p>						     1997	     1996</p>
<p>REVENUES AND SALES:</p>
<p>	     Total revenues and sales    816,880	  804,453</p>
<p>COSTS AND EXPENSES:</p>
<p>	     Total costs and expenses    644,721	  623,563</p>
<p> OPERATING INCOME			    172,159	  180,890</p>
<p> Gain on disposal of assets and other  155,993		---</p>
<p> Net income				    173,890	   91,908</p>
<p> Preferred dividends			     256		274</p>
<p>Net income applicable to common shares</p>
<p>						   173,634	   91,634</p>
<p> PRIMARY EARNINGS PER SHARE		  0 .92	     0.48</p>
<p>			   SIX MONTHS ENDED JUNE 30</p>
<p>							1997	    1996</p>
<p>REVENUES AND SALES:</p>
<p>	     Total revenues and sales  1,601,185	1,578,719</p>
<p>COSTS AND EXPENSES:</p>
