<p>NOTE: Second quarter earnings per share from operations were $0.52 compared with $0.48 a year ago.</p>
<p>In the second quarter, the company recognized a one-time net after-tax gain of about $76 million from the disposition of certain assets.</p>
<p>Analysts' consensus for the quarter was $0.52, according to First Call.</p>
